    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "reasoning": "The learner wants answers only, but the guided policy calls for a brief diagnostic question first. The likely trap is confusing Matthew and John because they share the surname Kumalo. Start with a separate, recognisable character to build a reliable match.",
