      "content": "You have a relevant starting point. This is an open-ended question: your yes-or-no choice is not what earns the credit; you need to support your view with a relevant event or detail from the novel. There is also a small grammar slip: write “he remains” because “he” takes “remains”.\n\nWhich event in the novel could you use to support your view?"
